        "from": "\"Fried, E.I. (Eiko)\" <e.i.fried@fsw.leidenuniv.nl>",
        "to": "\"support@ethicadata.com\" <support@ethicadata.com>, Faham Negini <support@avicennaresearch.com>, \"Toutounji, R. (Rayyan)\" <r.toutounji@fsw.leidenuniv.nl>",
        "cc": null,
        "subject": "Data export problems",
        "reply_to": null,
        "message_id": "<PR3PR09MB52495E235BDD2B495DE1AD88E1452@PR3PR09MB5249.eurprd09.prod.outlook.com>",
        "message_id_md5": "13d99382b6c38bbb726517784ba7996d",
        "in_reply_to": null,
        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "<div>\n<p>Dear <span lang=\"EN-US\">Avicenna team</span>,<br>\n<br>\n<span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">A member in the WARN-D team, our postdoc Rayyan (in CC), was trying </span>to download the data for our study (ID: 2385) using the link provided (<a href=\"http://ethicadata.com/media/public/2385_data.zip\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">http://ethicadata.com/media/public/2385_data.zip</a>)<span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">We</span> noticed that not all data is downloaded, with only data up to the 2nd of August available despite the study running until the 3rd of September. When compared to direct downloads via the Avicenna Dashboard, we see that we do indeed have data dated as late as the 3rd of September, and it is therefore not an issue of compliance.<span lang=\"DE\"></span></p>\n<p><br> As our processing pipelines would need to work on data in a consistent manner, and the direct download seems to be formatted differently, we were wondering if it is possible to receive and updated version of the data as before, using the link.<span lang=\"DE\"></span></p>\n<p><br>\n<span lang=\"DE\">Thanks</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"DE\"> Eiko </span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"DE\"> </span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"DE\">PS: please respond to all so that Rayyan also receives the response, thanks </span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#666666;\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#666666;\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#666666;\">__</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><b><span style=\"color:#666666;\">Dr </span></b><b><span style=\"color:#666666;\">​</span></b><b><span style=\"color:#666666;\">Eiko Fried </span></b></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#666666;\">Associate Professor</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#666666;\">Department of Clinical Psychology</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#666666;\">Leiden University </span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#595959;\">Mentor research master students clinical &amp; health trac</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#595959;\">k</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.universiteitleiden.nl/en/yal\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://www.universiteitleiden.nl/en/yal\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1;\">Young Academy Leiden</span></a><span style=\"color:#595959;\"> &amp;</span><a href=\"https://www.universiteitleiden.nl/open-science-community-leiden\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://www.universiteitleiden.nl/open-science-community-leiden\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#595959;\">\n</span><span style=\"color:#0563c1;\">Open Science Community Leiden</span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#595959;\">Project </span><a href=\"https://www.universiteitleiden.nl/en/social-behavioural-sciences/psychology/good-practises/responsible-scholarship\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://www.universiteitleiden.nl/en/social-behavioural-sciences/psychology/good-practises/responsible-scholarship\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1;\">Responsible Scholarship</span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#666666;\">Meet me in my </span><a href=\"https://universiteitleiden.zoom.us/my/eikofried?pwd=UjZ5Q2lvcVBQMnllT0V3WkZ5UXdVZz09\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://universiteitleiden.zoom.us/my/eikofried?pwd=UjZ5Q2lvcVBQMnllT0V3WkZ5UXdVZz09\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:purple;\">zoom</span></a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://eiko-fried.com\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://eiko-fried.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc;\">My website</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666;\">: Blog, publications, lectures, code, &amp; data</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://warn-d.com\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://warn-d.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc;\">WARN-D</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666;\">: Building an early warning system for depression</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://eiko-fried.com/wp-content/uploads/CV.pdf\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://eiko-fried.com/wp-content/uploads/CV.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc;\">CV</span></a><span style=\"color:#202124;\">\n</span><span style=\"color:#666666;\">| </span><a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=DUK0qQoAAAAJ&amp;hl=en\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=DUK0qQoAAAAJ&amp;hl=en\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc;\">Google Scholar</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666;\"> | </span><a href=\"https://twitter.com/EikoFried/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://twitter.com/EikoFried/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc;\">Twitte</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1155cc;\">r/X</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666;\"> | </span><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/eikofried.bsky.social\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://bsky.app/profile/eikofried.bsky.social\" target=\"_blank\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color:#1155cc;\">Bluesky</span></a><span style=\"color:#666666;\"> | </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwE0UmLcUSt0att9zhzXKkA\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwE0UmLcUSt0att9zhzXKkA\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc;\">Youtube</span></a>\n<span style=\"color:#666666;\">| </span><a href=\"https://eiko-fried.com/team/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://eiko-fried.com/team/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc;\">My team</span></a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\">\n<p><span style=\"color:#202124;\"><img border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:100%;width:1.5in;max-height:.6145in;\" src=\"/api/v1/ticket_attachment/25822/79060/133568?view=inline\" alt=\"signature_1602643119\"></span></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:145.25pt;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\">\n<p><a href=\"https://warn-d.com/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://warn-d.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155cc;\"><img border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:100%;width:1.6041in;max-height:.6041in;\" src=\"/api/v1/ticket_attachment/25822/79060/133569?view=inline\" alt=\"signature_2423302377\"></span></a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p> </p>\n</div>",
