        "body": "<p>Hi Eiko</p><p>I'm writing to inform you that the issue regarding the data export is now fixed and you can test it. Please check and let me know of the issue persists.</p><div data-signature=\"true\" data-signature-id=\"2\">\n<p><br>Best regards,<br>Amin<br><br><br></p>\n<p>Note: If you feel like your issue is not properly being addressed and want to escalate it, please click here: <a rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com/app/public/zammad/escalate/25822/47db698311f28b88\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com/app/public/zammad/escalate/25822/47db698311f28b88</a><br><br></p>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<p>--<br>Avicenna Research (formerly Ethica Data)<br><br></p>\n<p>4109 - 295 Adelaide St W, Toronto, ON M5V 0L4, Canada</p>\n<p>Email: support@avicennaresearch.com - Web: <a rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com</a><br>--</p>\n</div><blockquote type=\"cite\">\n<p>On Tuesday, October 15, 2024 at 5:12:25 PM, E i.fried wrote:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Dear Avicenna team,<br><br><br></p>\n<p>A member in the WARN-D team, our postdoc Rayyan (in CC), was trying to download the data for our study (ID: 2385) using the link provided (<a rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" href=\"http://ethicadata.com/media/public/2385_data.zip\" target=\"_blank\">http://ethicadata.com/media/public/2385_data.zip</a>).</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>We noticed that not all data is downloaded, with only data up to the 2nd of August available despite the study running until the 3rd of September. When compared to direct downloads via the Avicenna Dashboard, we see that we do indeed have data dated as late as the 3rd of September, and it is therefore not an issue of compliance.</p>\n<p><br>As our processing pipelines would need to work on data in a consistent manner, and the direct download seems to be formatted differently, we were wondering if it is possible to receive and updated version of the data as before, using the link.</p>\n<p><br>Thanks</p>\n<p>Eiko</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>PS: please respond to all so that Rayyan also receives the response, thanks</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>__</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>Dr ​Eiko Fried</strong><br></p>\n<p>Associate Professor</p>\n<p>Department of Clinical Psychology</p>\n<p>Leiden University</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Mentor research master students clinical &amp; health track</p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://www.universiteitleiden.nl/en/yal\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.universiteitleiden.nl/en/yal\">Young Academy Leiden</a> &amp;<a rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://www.universiteitleiden.nl/open-science-community-leiden\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.universiteitleiden.nl/open-science-community-leiden\">Open Science Community Leiden</a><br></p>\n<p>Project <a rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://www.universiteitleiden.nl/en/social-behavioural-sciences/psychology/good-practises/responsible-scholarship\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.universiteitleiden.nl/en/social-behavioural-sciences/psychology/good-practises/responsible-scholarship\">Responsible Scholarship</a><br></p>\n<p>Meet me in my <a rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://universiteitleiden.zoom.us/my/eikofried?pwd=UjZ5Q2lvcVBQMnllT0V3WkZ5UXdVZz09\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://universiteitleiden.zoom.us/my/eikofried?pwd=UjZ5Q2lvcVBQMnllT0V3WkZ5UXdVZz09\">zoom</a><br></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://eiko-fried.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://eiko-fried.com\">My website</a>: Blog, publications, lectures, code, &amp; data</p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://warn-d.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://warn-d.com\">WARN-D</a>: Building an early warning system for depression</p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://eiko-fried.com/wp-content/uploads/CV.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://eiko-fried.com/wp-content/uploads/CV.pdf\">CV</a>| <a rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=DUK0qQoAAAAJ&amp;hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=DUK0qQoAAAAJ&amp;hl=en\">Google Scholar</a> | <a rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://twitter.com/EikoFried/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://twitter.com/EikoFried/\">Twitter/X</a> | <a rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/eikofried.bsky.social\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://bsky.app/profile/eikofried.bsky.social\">Bluesky</a> | <a rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwE0UmLcUSt0att9zhzXKkA\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwE0UmLcUSt0att9zhzXKkA\">Youtube</a>| <a rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://eiko-fried.com/team/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://eiko-fried.com/team/\">My team</a><br></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img src=\"/api/v1/ticket_attachment/25822/79780/134723?view=inline\" alt=\"signature_1602643119\" style=\"max-width:100%;width:708px;max-height:708px;\"><br></p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://warn-d.com/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://warn-d.com/\"><img src=\"/api/v1/ticket_attachment/25822/79780/134724?view=inline\" alt=\"signature_2423302377\" style=\"max-width:100%;width:838px;max-height:838px;\"></a><br></p>\n<p> </p>\n</blockquote>",
